 InputUsernameAndPassword;defMat;DT;r;parms;∆
⍝ `Input` asks just for user name and password
 DT←##.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Username' 'Your username or email address:' ''DT.Character 20 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Password' 'Your password:' ''DT.Password 20 1 1
 defMat⍪←'PH1' '' ''DT.PlaceHolder 1 1 1
 defMat⍪←'PH2' '' ''DT.PlaceHolder 1 1 2
 defMat⍪←'Show' '&Show the password' ''DT.YesNo 20 1 2

 parms←##.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←55 35
 parms.vGap←6
 parms.initialVgap←60
 parms.hGap←60
 parms.alignButtons←##.APLGUI.Enums.Align.Center
 parms.caption←'Username and password'
 parms.onInitial←##.APLGUI_Demo.InputUsernameAndPassword_'OnInitial'
 parms.onChange←'##.APLGUI_Demo.InputUsernameAndPassword_.OnChange'

 r←parms ##.APLGUI.Input.Run defMat
 ⎕SE.aplteam.Display r
⍝Done
